    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20471" root="سلف" body-key="s">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّف</span></b>  <i>He received payment in advance:</i>
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استسلف</span></b>  [perhaps a mistranscription for
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلف</span></b> ] signifies [the same; or] <i>he took,</i> or
<i>received, what is termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَلَف</span>. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [And
hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّف مِنْهُ</span> <i>He received from him a
loan;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِقْتَرَضَ</span>; as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استلف</span></b> . (A in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قرض</span>.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّف مِنْهُ كَذَا</span> <i>He received as a
loan from him such a thing.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See
also 10. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسلّف</span> <i>He ate the</i> [<i>portion of
food termed</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُلْفَة</span>. (MA.) [See also 2.]

